{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wufan-e-91bd5712916ed2f91fd8","title":"孙权遂征黄祖，卒不能克","accounts":[{"id":"wufan-a-91bd5712916ed2f91fd8","label":"正文","text":"孙权遂征黄祖，卒不能克","evidence":["wufan-q-e297cdefd9d420d39248"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"征讨黄祖者","evidence":["wufan-q-e297cdefd9d420d39248"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0033","role":"被攻而未克者","evidence":["wufan-q-e297cdefd9d420d39248"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wufan-q-e297cdefd9d420d39248"]},"ordering_evidence":"wufan-q-e297cdefd9d420d39248","order":10850}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0033","name":"黄祖","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wufan-q-e297cdefd9d420d39248","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-b84cf48ba2c7aa9dcf0c","layer":"original","quote":"会孙权起于东南，范委身服事。每有灾祥，辄推数言状；其术多效，遂以显名。初，权在吴，欲讨黄祖。范曰：“今兹少利，不如明年。明年戊子〖4〗，荆州刘表亦身死国亡。”权遂征祖，卒不能克。明年，军出。行及寻阳，范见风气，因诣船贺，催兵急行。至即破祖，祖（得）夜亡〖5〗。权恐失之，范曰：“未远，必生擒祖。”至五更中，果得之。刘表竟死，荆州分割。","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":167}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
